 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Universal closedness is Zariski local on the target",
 "statement": "Let $f:X\\to S$ be a morphism of schemes [def-pc-scheme]. Suppose $S$ is covered by open subschemes $V_k$ and, for every $k$, the restriction $f^{-1}(V_k)\\to V_k$ is universally closed [def-weil-proper-morphism]. Then $f$ is universally closed.",
 "source": {
